        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARCHM, Chambord Clear Crystal Knob with Carre Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Chambord Clear Crystal Knob with Carre Rose has a classic design that is well suited for traditional spaces. Designers choose the Chambord Crystal Knob with Carre Short Plate for its versatile look that is both romantic and  beautiful. The Carre Short Plate with Chambord Crystal Knob, like most of Grandeur's Knobsets, is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. The Carre Short Plate is available in several finish options, all of which look stunning when paired with the clear 24% Lead Crystal Chambord Knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CARCHM Carre Rosette with Chambord Clear Crystal Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Carre Plate with Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: 24% Lead Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.11</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARCHM-specifications.pdf?v=1704262391\"><b>Grandeur CARCHM Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
