                "description": "The Chambord Clear Crystal Knob with Carre Rose has a classic design that is well suited for traditional spaces. Designers choose the Chambord Crystal Knob with Carre Short Plate for its versatile look that is both romantic and  beautiful. The Carre Short Plate with Chambord Crystal Knob, like most of Grandeur's Knobsets, is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. The Carre Short Plate is available in several finish options, all of which look stunning when paired with the clear 24% Lead Crystal Chambord Knob.",
